/// <summary>
/// The game's catalogue of character parts: each body, face (head), hairstyle and beard, per
/// gender, which is 'male' by default or 'female'. An option is { name, part, gender, group }.
/// Apply a look with Player.setAppearance({ gender, body, head, hair, beard }), where '' keeps the
/// game's part. (Server only.)
